{"format":"nexus-update-v1","version":"2.0.1","notes":"Full quality by default: only caveman talk and the project vault stay on. Helper agents now use the same model as the main agent, team reviewers are no longer downgraded, and long chats are not squashed. Every new chat reads the project vault first. Also fixes 'Never' for squashing long chats.","payload":"","signature":"+nGpb3bMFvfG8e0JSWN9wlSPaMBi7pHEID9VUBuFIxm6I7/OTQAQ1kFF6uaekjIYdGov4PpOJTzmBs7F/IC0Bw=="}